            {
              "line_number": 1063,
              "content": "      <p>Reserve <strong>ADR-0020+</strong> for: WASM plugins, DAP deep design, CRDT collab, marketplace PKI, renderer backend swap, LuaJIT backend, NRPC major v2, enterprise policy engine, etc.</p>"
            },
            {
              "line_number": 1073,
              "content": "  <p>Engineering phases (Phase 0…6 in <a href=\"#roadmap\">Implementation Roadmap</a>) are execution slices. <strong>Product milestones</strong> below are what contributors and users orient on. See <a href=\"#adr-0019\">ADR-0019</a>.</p>"
            },
            {
              "line_number": 1158,
              "content": "            <td><a href=\"#adr-0003\">ADR-0003</a></td>"
            },
            {
              "line_number": 1166,
